bind ctrl-, any sideBySideContinuousMode
bind ctrl-. any sideBySideSingleMode
bind ctrl-R any loadSession
bind ctrl-F any fullScreenMode sideBySideSingleMode
unbind up any
unbind left any
unbind down any
unbind right any
bind up fullScreen,singlePage prevPage
bind left fullScreen,singlePage prevPage
bind down fullScreen,singlePage nextPage
bind right fullScreen,singlePage nextPage
bind k fullScreen,singlePage prevPage
bind h fullScreen,singlePage prevPage
bind j fullScreen,singlePage nextPage
bind l fullScreen,singlePage nextPage
